('CIT_MAN_PTAHIL_MANDAE','ENT_MAN_PTAHIL','SRC_MANDAEAN_BOOK_JOHN','The Mandaean Book of John','The Mandaean Book of John','Ptahil caused works to be destroyed, and the Cloud revealed the light''s secret. 45 Transplant disturbed the settlements, Behram said a word when it did not exist. Ptahil brought a great weapon, and Sprout waged war against the world. Excellent Hibel caught praise, divided it up, and cast it about in many places. This was taken to the voice.','Häberl & McGrath',2020,'None',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'Open-access translation; located by name; verify.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1)
